<title>USA: Nobel Education Dynamics names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Nobel Education Dynamics names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MEDIA, Pa. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nobel Education Dynamics Inc said Brian Zwaan had been hired as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Zwaan is currently senior vice president of Summit Bank, where he has been employed since 1990, Nobel said.</p>
<p>He fills a position that has been vacant for six months, a Nobel spokesman said.</p>
